[{"client_msg_id":"840a70b0-c970-413a-8d77-6b42de3bf8b0","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あとは coc.nvim だとファイルタイプのマッピングの設定で .vimrc/init.vim レベルに追加できる `g:coc_filetype_map` ってのがありまして。例えばこんなふうな設定をすると `yaml.docker-compose` や `yaml.ansible` も yaml として拡張や言語サーバー側に扱ってもらうみたいな設定もあります。 `:h g:coc_filetype_map`\n```let g:coc_filetype_map = {\n  \\ 'yaml.docker-compose': 'yaml',\n  \\ 'yaml.ansible': 'yaml',\n  \\ }```","ts":"1616847746.137100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U6Vl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8af9ff43-ace9-4039-92c0-e197678515b1","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"coc-stylelintplus ならファイル全体のコードアクションで `Apply all stylelint fixes` ってのが出ておそらくそれが `stylelint --fix` 相当だと思います。\nあとは `stylelintplus.filetypes` って設定があるので coc-settings.json で設定追加すれば必要なファイルタイプにも適用できそうです。","ts":"1616847566.136900","thread_ts":"1616847566.136900","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0/+W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de78b27c-9093-49d0-8e07-899ef576154a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e さん。coc-stylelint じゃなくて coc-stylelintplus は試しましたか？","ts":"1616846027.136700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I0Vr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87747926-c238-431f-b95c-539e6370d640","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー....","ts":"1616844898.136100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zbznz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e349b6b-3077-4bc9-b47c-0b5ed9785fd4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"経験則なんですけど、多分coc extensionsからTSで登録したものだけCodeActionになってるような気がするんですよね・・・","ts":"1616844698.135900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pRv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35076548-5d7f-4580-bf38-60fc8d187a44","type"