ocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jjXP="}]},{"client_msg_id":"216755c2-48e1-4183-ba84-18f9d777c426","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これバグっぽいからIssue立てようかなぁ","ts":"1616828601.116200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TF36"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc1b3fd7-b7c2-44e3-9a1d-c2bf41c1d312","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なるほど、coc起因か\nすいませんでした","ts":"1616828440.115800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"iinoyo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3IgE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37249ddb-708c-416e-94c2-30bf9b53d9aa","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、なってそうね","ts":"1616828414.115500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GgD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a5cd1f9-27ad-4ae3-8e82-b461e169b9d0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、いや、後からft変更してもバッファ状態が反映されてないから `typescript` 以外は再確認がいる","ts":"1616828403.115300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=vC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c384862-8414-44f0-8e47-db28fe860dc9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```    \"efm\": {\n      \"command\": \"efm-langserver\",\n      \"filetypes\": [\"typescriptreact\", \"go\", \"ruby\", \"vim\", \"sh\", \"zsh\", \"markdown\"]\n    }```\nしているので、ここでtypescriptでもtypescript.tsxのどっちも弾かれるようになっていたとかはありそう","ts":"1616828357.114600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TOZZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ced03430-7f7e-4079-852b-2ca175149e95","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いや、自分はそっちでは見てなくて\n```  typescript:\n    - \u0026lt;\u0026lt;: *eslint-lint\n    - \u0026lt;\u0026lt;: *prettier-action-fix```\nがどっちでも動いたのを確認した","ts":"1616828348.114400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EEVEs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39495e09-78f3-4206-bec7-85a2d6e34e81","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```languages:\n  typescriptreact:\n    - \u0026lt;\u0026lt;: *stylelint-lint```\nのtypescriptreactの部分がどっちでも動作しました？\ncoc側の起動判定がバグってる可能性はありそう","ts":"1616828307.113300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YSC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49938d09-7329-46a7-8de5-0c3d82b7f570","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ふうむ...","ts":"1616828279.112700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yaNQb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db8911a3-0d27-4585-83b7-834719b0b6e6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、結果としてひとまずtypescriptreactにするので回避できるのでもうそっちに直そうとはしています","ts":"1616828257.112200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gbsxM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a81fd5b4-d3f8-411f-95e7-0126c697de4c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"んー、いや、設定ファイルに定義があれば効くんじゃない?\n`typescript` でも `typescript.tsx`でもtypescriptに定義したものが適用されたよ?\nただvim-lspなんで、coc側でなにが起きてるかはわからない","ts":"1616828223.111500","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1616828235.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ldvKx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab8fe503-bcde-4f4e-b776-ba0424341208","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そしてcoc-stylelintは色々やったけど動かないっていう、それでefmに乗り換えようとして大分詰まった","ts":"1616828091.110300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"phWz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa980695-a433-4cc3-93cd-4ce4c2a1f9bc","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"具体的にはtypescript.tsxにstylelint適用させようとして無理でした","ts":"1616827996.109800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e3c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14e96216-21fd-4e68-9a48-55b39ea94161","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"処理的にはサブタイプは無視だったっけ?...ちょっと見てみよ","ts":"1616827952.109400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DTx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be6482e8-b131-4efb-a45d-32e7ff15d467","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@U03C6TEAZ\u003e \u003c@UAZ33BKV2\u003e ちょっと誰が適切か微妙だったので\ntsxファイルのftをtypescript.tsxにしてるんですが、efmのlanguagesでtypescript、typescript.tsxをどっちを指定しても動かないみたいです\nこれ回避する方法ってあるでしょうか\n\n一時的にtypescriptreactにしたら期待通り動作しました","ts":"1616827818.108800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QNbZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fa0f77b-aa38-4e36-86bd-734ed72c2624","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```$ yarn run stylelint src/**/*.tsx --fix```\nで落ちるから根本的にstylelintが悪いやつだこれ","ts":"1616872664.138200","thread_ts":"1616847566.136900","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1616872673.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U7TMPGWJ0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1mn"}]}]
